    old "My cousin used to think he could beat me in a fight. He stopped thinking that around age 14."
    new "Mi primo solía creer que podía ganarme en una pelea. Dejó de creerlo como a los 14."

    old "Working out clears my head. When I'm stressed about exams, thirty minutes of hitting a bag fixes everything."
